# Env carries secrets — nothing else.
#
# Everything about a deployment other than its secrets is declared in code at its composition
# root: which offerings and calculators compose, in what priority, each offering's settings, and
# the root store's shape (see OFFERINGS / CALCULATORS / ROOT_STORE in src/meteoscape/server.py).
# A config file may fill the same fields later — docs/tickets/01-0125-supported-python-embedding.md.
#
# One secret per keyed offering, at METEOSCAPE_<IMPL>_<SLOT> (uppercase; hyphens in the impl id
# become underscores). Only the offerings a profile declares are read; any other variable is
# inert. A profile declaring a keyed offering without its secret refuses startup.
#
# The shipped server profile is keyless Open-Meteo, so the line below matters only to a profile
# that declares TWC.
METEOSCAPE_TWC_API_KEY=
